---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Quick start" description="Install valdix, write your first schema, read your first error.">
  <h1>Quick start</h1>
  <p class="lede">Install, define a schema, parse. Three steps, one dependency (none).</p>
  <h2>Install</h2>
  <pre><code>npm install @denisetiya/valdix</code></pre>
  <h2>First schema</h2>
  <pre><code>import v from "@denisetiya/valdix";

const Signup = v.object(&#123;
  name: v.string().min(3),
  email: v.string().email(),
  age: v.number().min(18),
&#125;);

type Signup = v.Infer&lt;typeof Signup&gt;;
// → &#123; name: string; email: string; age: number &#125;</code></pre>
  <h2>First error</h2>
  <pre><code>v.useLang("id");
const r = Signup.safeParse(&#123; name: "", email: "bad", age: 15 &#125;);
// r.errors[0].message === "name minimal 3 karakter"
// r.errors[1].message === "Alamat email tidak valid"
// r.errors[2].message === "age minimal 18"</code></pre>
  <p>Each error carries <code>path</code>, <code>code</code>, <code>message</code>, <code>field</code>, and <code>description</code>. Map <code>r.errors</code> directly in your UI.</p>
  <h2>Next</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/api">API</a> for every factory and modifier.</li>
    <li><a href="/i18n">i18n</a> for language switching and custom locales.</li>
  </ul>
</Base>
